  "question": "设 x²+y²=1，求 dy/dx；又 x=cos t，y=sin t，求 dy/dx（用 t 表示）。",
  "answer": "隐函数：dy/dx=−x/y；参数式：dy/dx=−cot t。",
  "techniques": [
    "隐函数求导",
    "参数方程求导",
    "链式法则"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "对 x²+y²=1 两边对 x 求导：2x+2y y'=0 ⇒ y'=−x/y。"
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "参数式 dy/dx=(dy/dt)/(dx/dt)=(cos t)/(−sin t)=−cot t。"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "隐函数：dy/dx=−x/y；参数式：dy/dx=−cot t。",
